    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The [[lookup @name lowercase]] conjures an animal spirit that strikes at a creature and then disappears. <em>Dexterity Saving Throw:</em> DC [[lookup @save.dc.value activity=cx21u9ZYjSdu2m3U]], one creature the [[lookup @name lowercase]] can see within [[lookup @range.value activity=cx21u9ZYjSdu2m3U]] feet. <em>Failure:</em> [[/damage average]] damage. <em>Success:</em> Half damage. <em>Failure or Success:</em> One of the following effects occurs:</p><p class=\"feature-trait\"><strong>Fortify (Forager Only).</strong> The [[lookup @name lowercase]] gains [[lookup @healing.formula activity=emHqEek8e9Mwyaj7]] Temporary Hit Points.</p><p class=\"feature-trait\"><strong>Marked as Prey (Hunter Only).</strong> The [[lookup @name lowercase]] has Advantage on attack rolls against the target until the start of the [[lookup @name lowercase]]'s next turn.</p><p class=\"feature-trait\"><strong>Pesky Swarm (Sage Only).</strong> The target has Disadvantage on attack rolls and ability checks until the end of its next turn.</p>",
